---
const pageTitle = 'BF Card Preview | BF GYM Global';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"/>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0d1110"/>
<meta name="description" content="Create a private, on-device BF GYM profile preview with a display name, fitness interest and optional Instagram handle. Preview your non-functional digital member card without creating an online account."/>
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow"/>
<link rel="canonical" href="https://bfgym.netlify.app/join/"/>
<link rel="icon" href="/bf-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/>
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<title>{pageTitle}</title>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
<a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="BF GYM home"><span class="mark">BF<span>.</span></span><span>GYM <b>GLOBAL</b></span></a>
<a class="back" href="/">← Discover</a>
</header>
<main class="wrap">
<div class="heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="pinkdot"></span> BF GYM GLOBAL / PERSONAL CARD PREVIEW</div><h1>YOUR FITNESS.<br/><em>YOUR CARD.</em></h1><p>Create a private card preview with a display name, a fitness interest and an optional Instagram username. Simple and free to try.</p></div>
<div class="disclosure" role="note"><strong><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span> Private profile preview — not an online account.</strong><p>Anyone can try this free preview, but it is saved only in this browser on this device. We do not upload, publish or verify profiles. Your card is a non-valid demonstration, not an active membership, QR pass, or proof of identity. Real registrations are not open yet.</p></div>
<div class="layout">
  <section class="form-card" aria-labelledby="form-title">
    <div class="form-top"><div><span class="mini">01 / PROFILE DETAILS</span><h2 id="form-title">YOUR DETAILS.</h2></div><div class="heartshape" aria-hidden="true">BF.</div></div>
    <form id="member-form" autocomplete="off">
      <label for="display-name">What should we call you? <span class="required">*</span></label>
      <input id="display-name" name="display-name" type="text" maxlength="40" required placeholder="Your first name or nickname" autocomplete="nickname"/>
      <p class="helper">Use a nickname if you like. Please don't add medical details or private information.</p>

      <label for="fitness-goal">What are you into?</label>
      <div class="select-wrap"><select id="fitness-goal" name="fitness-goal"><option value="Starting my fitness journey">🌱 Just starting</option><option value="Getting stronger">💪 Strength training</option><option value="Cardio & movement">🏃 Cardio & movement</option><option value="Learning & consistency">✨ Learning & consistency</option></select></div>

      <label for="instagram">Instagram <span class="optional">optional</span></label>
      <div class="input-prefix"><span aria-hidden="true">@</span><input id="instagram" name="instagram" type="text" inputmode="text" maxlength="30" placeholder="yourhandle" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="none" autocomplete="off"/></div>
      <p class="helper">Only a handle, not a password. Leave blank if you prefer. This link appears only on your own preview card.</p>
      <p class="error" id="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
      <button class="save-btn" type="submit">CREATE CARD PREVIEW <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
    </form>
    <div class="form-foot"><div class="lock" aria-hidden="true">♡</div><p>No email. No passwords. No server signup. Saved only in this browser, and you can erase it below.</p></div>
    <button id="clear-profile" class="clear-btn" type="button">Erase my local preview</button>
  </section>

  <section class="preview-col" aria-labelledby="card-title">
    <div class="card-frame">
      <div class="preview-head"><span>02 / CARD PREVIEW</span><span class="preview-indicator">PRIVATE TO THIS DEVICE</span></div>
      <div class="member-card" id="member-card">
        <div class="card-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="card-top"><span class="card-logo">BF<span>.</span> GYM <small>GLOBAL</small></span><span class="demo-chip">DEMO ONLY</span></div>
        <div class="card-avatar" id="preview-avatar" aria-hidden="true">BF</div>
        <div class="card-small-label">MY FITNESS VIBE</div>
        <h2 id="preview-name">Your name here</h2>
        <p id="preview-goal">🌱 Starting my fitness journey</p>
        <div class="card-bottom"><span>BF / PERSONAL PREVIEW</span><span>BEST FITNESS GLOBAL</span></div>
      </div>
      <p id="preview-instagram" class="instagram-preview" hidden>Instagram: <a id="instagram-link" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a></p>
      <div id="saved-message" class="saved-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div class="next-step"><div><strong>Found your fitness vibe?</strong><p>Now discover the free workout plan that fits.</p></div><a href="/programmes/">Explore plans ↗</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="future"><div class="star" aria-hidden="true">✓</div><div><h3>What about real memberships?</h3><p>A secure online registration system, public profiles, community matching and active cards would need authentication, moderation, age-appropriate safeguards, data protection and private user storage. Those features are not live. This preview is for exploring the design.</p></div></div>
  </section>
</div>
<footer><a href="/">← Back to BF GYM</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy information</a><a href="/app/membership/">Existing member-card concept</a></footer>
</main>
<script>
  const key = 'bfgym-local-profile-preview-v1';
  const form = document.getElementById('member-form');
  const nameInput = document.getElementById('display-name');
  const goalInput = document.getElementById('fitness-goal');
  const instagramInput = document.getElementById('instagram');
  const error = document.getElementById('form-error');
  const nameOutput = document.getElementById('preview-name');
  const avatarOutput = document.getElementById('preview-avatar');
  const goalOutput = document.getElementById('preview-goal');
  const instaRow = document.getElementById('preview-instagram');
  const instaLink = document.getElementById('instagram-link');
  const status = document.getElementById('saved-message');
  const clear = document.getElementById('clear-profile');
  const validHandle = /^[A-Za-z0-9._]{1,30}$/;
  const goals = ['Starting my fitness journey','Getting stronger','Cardio & movement','Learning & consistency'];
  function cleanInstagram(value) {
    const candidate = value.trim().replace(/^@/,'');
    return candidate;
  }
  function showPreview(profile) {
    const displayName = profile.name || 'Your name here';
    nameOutput.textContent = displayName;
    avatarOutput.textContent = profile.name ? displayName.trim().charAt(0).toUpperCase() : 'BF';
    const goal = goals.includes(profile.goal) ? profile.goal : goals[0];
    goalOutput.textContent = goal;
    const handle = profile.instagram || '';
    if (handle && validHandle.test(handle)) {
      instaRow.hidden = false;
      instaLink.textContent = '@' + handle;
      instaLink.href = 'https://www.instagram.com/' + encodeURIComponent(handle) + '/';
    } else {
      instaRow.hidden = true;
      instaLink.removeAttribute('href');
      instaLink.textContent = '';
    }
  }
  function saveLocal(profile) {
    try { localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(profile)); return true; } catch (_) { return false; }
  }
  let savedProfile = null;
  try {
    const parsed = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key) || 'null');
    if (parsed && typeof parsed.name === 'string' && typeof parsed.goal === 'string') savedProfile = parsed;
  } catch (_) {}
  if (savedProfile) {
    nameInput.value = savedProfile.name.slice(0,40);
    goalInput.value = goals.includes(savedProfile.goal) ? savedProfile.goal : goals[0];
    instagramInput.value = (savedProfile.instagram || '').slice(0,30);
    showPreview(savedProfile);
    status.textContent = 'Your previous on-device preview is ready.';
  }
  form.addEventListener('submit',event=>{
    event.preventDefault();
    error.hidden = true;
    const name = nameInput.value.trim().replace(/\s+/g,' ');
    const instagram = cleanInstagram(instagramInput.value);
    if (name.length < 2 || name.length > 40) {
      error.textContent = 'Enter a name or nickname between 2 and 40 characters.';
      error.hidden = false; nameInput.focus(); return;
    }
    if (instagram && !validHandle.test(instagram)) {
      error.textContent = 'Enter an Instagram username with letters, numbers, underscores or periods only (max 30 characters).';
      error.hidden = false; instagramInput.focus(); return;
    }
    const profile = {name,goal:goalInput.value,instagram};
    showPreview(profile);
    const persisted=saveLocal(profile);
    status.textContent = persisted ? 'Your private card preview is ready and saved in this browser.' : 'Your card preview is ready. This browser blocked local storage, so it may not remain after closing.';
    document.getElementById('member-card').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});
  });
  clear.addEventListener('click',()=>{
    try { localStorage.removeItem(key); }catch(_){}
    form.reset();
    showPreview({name:'',goal:goals[0],instagram:''});
    status.textContent = 'Your local profile preview has been cleared.';
    error.hidden = true;
  });
</script>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0d1110;--panel:#171f18;--line:#3b4839;--lime:#c7fa51;--text:#f4f7f0;--muted:#b4c3b0;--font:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif;--head:'Oswald',Impact,sans-serif}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:14px/1.75 var(--font);margin:0;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}p,h1,h2,h3{margin-top:0}h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--head);font-weight:700}button,input,select{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--lime);outline-offset:3px}
.topbar{height:76px;background:#111912;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:0 max(20px,calc((100vw - 1130px)/2))}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font:700 28px var(--head)}.brand b{font:800 10px var(--font);color:var(--lime);letter-spacing:.15em}.mark{font:700 24px var(--head);padding:8px 10px;background:#253123;color:#fff}.mark span{color:var(--lime)}.back{font-weight:900;font-size:11px;color:var(--lime);letter-spacing:.06em}.wrap{width:min(1130px,calc(100% - 34px));margin:0 auto}
.heading{padding:56px 0 30px;max-width:760px}.eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:10px;color:var(--lime);letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:900}.pinkdot{height:9px;width:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lime);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #c7fa5125}.heading h1{font-size:clamp(57px,8vw,100px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:22px 0}.heading h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--lime)}.heading>p{font-size:15px;color:#bacbb6;max-width:600px;line-height:1.85}
.disclosure{background:#1b271c;border:1px solid #435840;border-left:4px solid var(--lime);padding:16px 19px;margin-bottom:27px}.disclosure strong{font-size:12px;color:var(--lime)}.disclosure p{font-size:12px;color:#bdcbbb;margin:5px 0 0;line-height:1.8}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px;align-items:start}.form-card,.card-frame{background:#171f18;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px}.form-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.mini{font-size:10px;color:var(--lime);letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:900}.form-top h2{font-size:36px;line-height:1.1;margin:8px 0 25px}.heartshape{font:700 32px var(--head);color:#7b9e61}.form-card form{display:grid;gap:9px}.form-card label{font-size:12px;font-weight:900;margin-top:8px}.required{color:var(--lime)}.optional{font-weight:500;color:#b4c2b2;font-size:11px}.form-card input,.form-card select{width:100%;border:1px solid #52644c;background:#0e1510;color:#f4f7f0;border-radius:4px;height:49px;padding:0 15px;font-size:13px}.form-card input::placeholder{color:#9baa97}.form-card input:focus,.form-card select:focus{border-color:var(--lime)}.form-card select option{background:#172318}.helper{font-size:11px;color:#aebdab;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 10px}.input-prefix{display:flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid #52644c;border-radius:4px;background:#0e1510;overflow:hidden}.input-prefix>span{padding-left:16px;font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:var(--lime)}.input-prefix input{border:0;background:transparent}.save-btn{border:0;background:var(--lime);color:#1c2918;border-radius:4px;margin-top:14px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.04em;font-weight:900;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.save-btn:hover{background:#dafaa0}.save-btn span{font:700 25px var(--head)}.form-foot{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:25px}.lock{font-size:28px;color:var(--lime)}.form-foot p{font-size:11px;color:#afbeac;margin:0}.clear-btn{background:transparent;color:var(--lime);text-decoration:underline;border:0;padding:3px 0;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;margin-top:15px}.preview-col{display:grid;gap:20px}.preview-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:900;color:#b0c5ad}.preview-indicator{color:var(--lime)}.member-card{position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:315px;background:linear-gradient(130deg,#263a25,#121c15 54%,#4e713d);padding:26px;margin-top:17px;border:1px solid #c7fa5185;border-radius:18px;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 17px 33px #0005;isolation:isolate}.card-glow{position:absolute;border:40px solid #ffffff10;aspect-ratio:1;width:330px;right:-100px;top:-135px;border-radius:50%;z-index:0}.card-top,.card-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:7px;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:1}.card-logo{font:700 23px var(--head)}.card-logo span{color:var(--lime)}.card-logo small{font:800 9px var(--font);letter-spacing:.08em}.demo-chip{font-size:9px;font-weight:900;border:1px solid #d3f4be99;border-radius:3px;padding:5px 8px;color:#d5e8d0}.card-avatar{position:relative;width:62px;height:62px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#d2f5ba;color:#203518;border-radius:4px;margin:31px 0 12px;font:700 36px var(--head)}.card-small-label{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--lime);font-weight:900}.member-card h2{font-size:34px;line-height:1.1;margin:6px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.member-card>p{font-size:12px;color:#d9eace;margin-bottom:23px}.card-bottom{border-top:1px solid #ffffff55;padding-top:13px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:900}.instagram-preview{font-size:12px;margin:15px 0 0;color:#bfcdbb}.instagram-preview a{color:var(--lime);font-weight:900}.instagram-preview[hidden]{display:none}.saved-message{font-size:12px;color:var(--lime);min-height:18px;margin:12px 0}.next-step{padding:17px;background:#263425;border:1px solid #445d3e;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.next-step strong{font-size:13px}.next-step p{font-size:11px;color:#bfcbb9;margin:3px 0 0}.next-step a{background:var(--lime);color:#1e2b19;padding:11px 14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;white-space:nowrap}.future{display:flex;gap:14px;background:#1e291d;border:1px solid #42503e;padding:20px}.star{font-size:27px;color:var(--lime)}.future h3{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 6px}.future p{font-size:12px;color:#b3c1ae;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.error{padding:11px;background:#4c2424;border:1px solid #e46a6a;color:#ffd0d0;font-size:12px}.error[hidden]{display:none}footer{border-top:1px solid #43513e;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;font-size:11px;color:#aebaa8;font-weight:800;padding:27px 0 55px;margin-top:60px}footer a:hover{color:var(--lime)}
@media(max-width:760px){.topbar{height:65px}.brand{font-size:24px}.heading{padding:34px 0 22px}.heading>p{font-size:13px}.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:15px}.form-card,.card-frame{padding:21px}.member-card{min-height:305px;padding:23px}.next-step{flex-wrap:wrap}.next-step a{text-align:center;width:100%}.wrap{width:calc(100% - 26px)}.disclosure{padding:14px}.heading h1{font-size:64px}}
@media(max-width:380px){.heading h1{font-size:53px}.preview-indicator{font-size:8px}.card-top{gap:6px}.member-card h2{font-size:30px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>